---
import { repo, releases } from '../site';
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Your notes are just a folder.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Milky is a markdown editor for the Mac with Apple Notes' manners and none of its
      lock-in. Point it at any folder — on your Mac, in iCloud, in Dropbox, or a git
      repository — and start writing.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href={releases}>Download for Mac</a>
      <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="#storage">See how it stores things</a>
    </div>
    <p class="requirement">Requires macOS 14 or later. Nothing to sign in to.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { padding: clamp(56px, 11vw, 116px) 0 clamp(38px, 6vw, 60px); }
</style>
